# INVWINB.KEY - a key script of INVWIN, as INVWIN.KEY: a wrong password,
# refused in the login dialog, then the right one, which ALT-BS, the
# edit control's own undo, leaves as it is, and the end by File >
# Exit.  TEST/GOLDEN/WIN/INVWINB.SNP is its snapshot.
T READER
K TAB
T Wrong1986
K ENTER
S REFUSED
T Reader1986
K ALT-BS
S ALTBS
K ENTER
S READER
K ALT-F X
S GONE
